The style prop receives a new array `[styles.mh5]` on every render. While this is a single-element array, it still creates a new reference on each render. If the View component is memoized, this creates unnecessary re-renders.

**Suggested fix**: Since it's a single style, you can pass it directly without an array, or if the array is required by the component API, memoize it:

```tsx
// Option 1: Pass directly (if the component accepts it)
